        109.57817077636719,
        500.9650573730469,
        120.71064758300781
      ],
      "text": "This response discusses the advantages and the disadvantages of taking risks.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.66252899169922,
        123.64341735839844,
        515.0368041992188,
        148.5137176513672
      ],
      "text": "It puts much greater emphasis on risks in ‘professional life’. As this response is\nbelow 250 words (it is only 242), more could be added to include risks in ‘personal\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.66252899169922,
        151.4468231201172,
        511.8445739746094,
        162.57936096191406
      ],
      "text": "life’ along with some specific examples of risks that people commonly take. There\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.3354263305664,
        166.166259765625,
        515.1087646484375,
        246.64341735839844
      ],
      "text": "is a clear progression through the response and ideas are logically organised;\ndisadvantages are presented first and advantages second. Cohesive devices can\nbe quite mechanical with examples at the start of most sentences [First of all\n|\nHowever| On the other hand| Firstly] but referencing is generally appropriate [it |\nthis loss\n| They\n| The failure]. The first paragraph is very short and paragraphing is\nnot entirely logical.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.00826263427734,
        263.64178466796875,
        522.1119995117188,
        330.38104248046875
      ],
      "text": "Vocabulary is effective with some less common items [damage the society\n| receive\nhuge benefits\n| enable\n| obtain advantages ... from the process]. Occasional errors\nremain [object/ objective\n| point/ perspective]. Sentence structure is good, with\nfrequent error-free sentences. There is a variety of complex structures, including\nconditionals [if], but\na few errors remain.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.00827026367188,
        347.37908935546875,
        510.483642578125,
        372.2497253417969
      ],
      "text": "To improve this response, the word count of 250 should be reached and concrete\nexample(s) of risk could be provided.\n"
